# ============================================================
# ERP remediation git baseline — SAP_Architecture_Lab
# Established Phase 1 Closure Gate item 2 (2026-09-10).
# ============================================================

# Live and historical database snapshots — never commit business data, at any
# path (server/db.json, PHASE*_CHECKPOINT/server/db.json, db.json.bak,
# db.json.pre_*_backup, db.json.lock, PHASE_*_BASELINE/db.json.*, etc.)
**/db.json*

# Backup directories (code + data backups accumulated across every phase)
**/backups/

# Runtime lock file (ERP-005 single-instance lock — created automatically)
**/*.lock

# Server/boot logs generated by running or testing the app locally
**/*.log

# Local Claude Code / editor settings that are machine-specific or may hold
# local secrets (project's own launch.json — dev server port config, not a
# secret — is intentionally NOT excluded here; only settings.local.json is)
**/.claude/settings.local.json

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Packaged/regenerable build artifacts — not source, not committed
Appletree_ERP_Testing_Handover.zip

# Dependencies (none currently — this app deliberately uses zero npm
# packages, see server.js's own header comment — but future-proofed)
node_modules/

# Scratch/temp files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Generated test-run output (regenerated by running the historical suite —
# security_matrix.js writes this large results dump next to itself)
**/security_matrix_results.json
